<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Vera V4 · 商业模式</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="deck.css">
<style>
  *{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
  body{background:#070b16;color:#f5f7ff;font-family:"PingFang SC","Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif}
  .slide{width:100vw;height:100vh;min-height:650px;padding:5.5vh 6vw;display:flex;flex-direction:column;overflow:hidden;background:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 0,rgba(55,111,154,.2),transparent 43%),#070b16}
  .eyebrow{font-size:14px;color:#55d9ff;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:11px}h1{font-size:clamp(34px,4vw,60px);line-height:1.16}.sub{font-size:18px;color:#9fb0ca;margin-top:9px}
  .columns{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:24px;flex:1;margin-top:5vh}
  .column{background:rgba(255,255,255,.055);border-top:4px solid #ff718b;padding:28px}.column.future{border-color:#b795ff}
  .phase{font-size:13px;color:#8ea6c9;margin-bottom:12px}.title{font-size:28px;font-weight:780;margin-bottom:23px}.items{display:grid;gap:18px}.item{padding-bottom:17px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1)}.item:last-child{border-bottom:0}.item b{display:block;font-size:19px;margin-bottom:6px}.item span{color:#b7c4d8;line-height:1.5;font-size:15px}
  .note{margin-top:24px;padding:15px 18px;background:rgba(183,149,255,.11);border-left:3px solid #b795ff;color:#d8d0ee;font-size:15px}
  .foot{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:24px;margin-top:25px;padding-top:22px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14);font-size:clamp(19px,2.1vw,29px);font-weight:750}.foot span{color:#ffbd59}.foot small{font-size:14px;color:#94a6c0;font-weight:500}
  @media(max-width:900px){.columns{grid-template-columns:1fr}.slide{min-height:1000px}.foot{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main class="slide">
  <div class="eyebrow">VERA V4 · BUSINESS MODEL</div>
  <h1>商业模式证据待补充</h1>
  <div class="sub">当前材料不足以证明 Vera 已形成真实收入</div>

  <section class="columns">
    <article class="column">
      <div class="phase">CURRENT · NEEDS-INPUT</div>
      <div class="title">当前收入证据未闭合</div>
      <div class="items">
        <div class="item"><b>缺少真实收入证据</b><span>现有材料未提供合同、回款或已付费客户证据。</span></div>
        <div class="item"><b>不把规划写成现状</b><span>机构 SaaS、项目交付、专业服务均不能在证据缺失时表述为当前收入。</span></div>
        <div class="item"><b>需补充可核验输入</b><span>收入来源、计费方式及对应证据材料。</span></div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="column future">
      <div class="phase">FUTURE · 未来生态</div>
      <div class="title">生态开放</div>
      <div class="items">
        <div class="item"><b>平台授权模式</b><span>探索向同业开放</span></div>
        <div class="item"><b>Skill 生态</b><span>探索第三方开发者接入</span></div>
        <div class="item"><b>可信 AI 输出规范</b><span>推动标准形成</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="note">未来生态处于探索阶段，不计入当前收入</div>
    </article>
  </section>

  <div class="foot"><div><span>NEEDS-INPUT</span> · 当前收入栏暂不成立</div><small>不展示未经验证的商业事实或收入数字</small></div>
</main>
</body>
</html>
